---
import MainLayout from '../layouts/Main.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE, SITE_DESCRIPTION, SITE_STATEMENT } from '../consts';

const heroImages = [
  "/PCB_Assembly.jpg",
  "/Motor.jpg",
  "/3_Motors.jpg"
];
---
<MainLayout title={SITE_TITLE} description={SITE_DESCRIPTION} statement={SITE_STATEMENT} heroImages={heroImages}>
	<main>
		<p>
			In a future with millions of humanoids there will be an even greater number of stationary arms.
			The gap between the rising demand for goods and a falling labor participation rate will be 
			fulfilled by humanoids overseeing many stationary arms performing repetitive labor tasks.
			Stelth Robotics is building stationary arms to compliment humanoids in the creation of an abundant future.
		</p>
		<hr />
		<h2><a href={`/alpha-mini`}>Alpha-Mini</a></h2>
		<p>
			A 4dof robotic arm with made in North America that doesn't break the bank. Designed for desktop automation
			tasks, light assembly, and educational purposes.
		</p>
		<ul>
			<li>500mm maximum reach</li>
			<li>DC Motor Driven</li>
			<li>Magnetic joint position sensing</li>
			<li>STM32C0 MCU's in every joint </li>
			<li>Available for purchase fall 2026</li>
			<li>Launch day price of $999</li>
		</ul>
		<hr />
		<h2>Alpha</h2>
		<p>
			A 4dof robotic arm made for the real world. Designed for indoor and outdoor consumer use, 
			residential, and industrial settings.
		</p>
		<ul>
			<li>2000mm maximum reach</li>
			<li>DC Motor Driven</li>
			<li>CAN & Ethernet communication protocals</li>
			<li>STM32C0 MCU's in every joint </li>
			<li>Available for purchase fall 2027</li>
		</ul>
		<hr />
		<h2>Stay Updated</h2>
		<p>
			Want to stay updated on our progress and be the first to hear the big announcements?
			Join the mailing list <a href="https://forms.office.com/r/tBDJrsunn1" target="_blank" rel="noopener">here.</a>
		</p>
		
	</main>
</MainLayout>
